<node id="MPA-04939a6009d6f00be59b">
  <data key="d0">evidence</data>
  <data key="d14">MPA-04939a6009d6f00be59b</data>
  <data key="d15">MP005</data>
  <data key="d16">46</data>
  <data key="d17">https://www.desmi.com/media/dx1lnug1/t1542uk.pdf</data>
  <data key="d18">DESMI</data>
  <data key="d19">vibration levels above 7 mm/s are
                                                                                  
          damaging – i.e. this will result in shorter lifetimes of e.g. bearings and/or shaft seals in pumps (and
